<p><strong>{{ site.name }} is informational only.</strong> Nothing on this site is investment advice, financial advice, tax advice, legal advice, or any other professional advice. Nothing is a recommendation, solicitation, or offer to buy, sell, or hold a security, commodity, token, currency, or any other asset. We do not publish price predictions, price targets, or buy and sell calls. We do not tell you what to do with your money.</p>
